  ('5566658b-3fb1-5cb4-84a7-b8772678206b', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'self_development', 'O-1..O-2', 'active', 'Lieutenant — Self-Development', '3. Finance and Comptroller Regular Army Officer Development', 'Lieutenants must complete DoD FM Certification Level 1. They should strive to attain their Certified Defense Financial Manager (CDFM) and begin graduate level civilian courses. FC lieutenants should gain exposure to Data Analytics and seek additional FC functional training, including, but not limited to, Fiscal Law, PPBE, GFEBS Cost Management, and Business Objects (BOBJ) to enhance professional development.', '10c895eb5d458fc9c675de9619a5c18e3d3ea7b0ac0c9fda66fa591991148d37', 5, 5, '5', 11),
  ('7c3fdcd5-bd75-539c-90c4-5de42696696d', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'rank_duties', 'O-1..O-2', 'active', 'Lieutenant — Desired Experience', '3. Finance and Comptroller Regular Army Officer Development', 'Lieutenants serve in assignments where they practice fiduciary responsibility and gain an understanding of pecuniary liability for public funds entrusted to them. They must develop familiarity with FC core competencies, operational contract support (OCS), and FC information systems.', '9921a409ea50ec54843ad786a818c4de6cc3f2fb005b219ac41524a9a88e792b', 5, 5, '5', 12),
  ('7f2b868c-df7b-56c9-92fe-90c3d582854c', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'training', 'O-3', 'active', 'Captain — Education', '3. Finance and Comptroller Regular Army Officer Development', 'Completion of the FC Captains Career Course prepares the officer for KD and broadening assignments.', '39e86c9d0559643fcfc674889f3a95f1f49d3a658179f7125441a2ea3cd47234', 5, 5, '5', 13),
