  ('531b970d-81c1-5477-82e4-531981f98c47', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'assignments', 'O-3', 'active', 'Captain — Broadening Assignments', '3. Finance and Comptroller Regular Army Officer Development', 'Any job not listed as KD is considered broadening: “Purposeful expansion of an individual’s capabilities and understanding…that are gained through experiences in different organizational cultures and interest…” AR 600-3.
