  ('6c7fd62b-fed0-5b44-8c07-695095235a4c', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'assignments', 'O-6', 'active', 'Colonel — Broadening Assignments', '3. Finance and Comptroller Regular Army Officer Development', 'All non-KDB positions are considered broadening: “Purposeful expansion of an individual’s capabilities and understanding…that are gained through experiences in different organizational cultures and interest…” AR 600-3.
