  ('41cfcd2d-f8f4-5da3-b2bb-735e6ceab647', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'assignments', 'O-1..O-3', 'guard', 'Company Grade — Broadening assignments', '6. Finance and Comptroller Army National Guard Officer Development', '(a) State Budget Officer
(b) Brigade S-8
(c) Finance Battalion Staff', '25c961d68bbe83ddc0a827ebec4068ad16bc7e1ec0d9568413a2b140fee02646', 14, 14, '14', 54),
  ('e5b34ed6-b1b0-5173-bd6d-e1bf557a0bad', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'self_development', 'O-1..O-3', 'guard', 'Company Grade — Additional Training/Self Development', '6. Finance and Comptroller Army National Guard Officer Development', 'Company Grade Officers must obtain and maintain their mandated DoD Financial Management program certification at Level I or Level II as appropriate. Additionally, Company grade officers should strive for professional credentials. Examples include CDFM, CGFM, CGAP, or CPFO. Company grade officers should also seek additional Financial Management functional training, including classes through the ARNG Professional Education Center (PEC), USAFMCOM, or other agencies to ensure they are well- rounded. See Figure 1 for recommended functional training.', '9584044ca1f15187f4358282097e1d799aa43911f036c3df48b10743326609b0', 14, 14, '14', 55),
  ('fb8ea616-eb1d-5cf2-bd9d-8890275a31d7', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'rank_duties', 'O-1..O-3', 'guard', 'Company Grade — Desired Experience', '6. Finance and Comptroller Army National Guard Officer Development', 'Company grade officers are placed in assignments where they have fiduciary responsibility and pecuniary liability for public funds entrusted to them. They must be proficient in FC technical financial systems and disbursing operations.', 'f61497427b61b7529c01df9233e992244852b3cced0eb8c1edff9d5761274053', 14, 14, '14', 56),
  ('ad5082e4-590a-58ca-b1b1-59eb79463fe8', 'a6b40ab7-9883-5645-a496-0e2393fba45b', 'Army', 'officer', '36A', 'Finance and Comptroller Officer', 'training', 'O-4..O-6', 'guard', 'Field Grade — Education', '6. Finance and Comptroller Army National Guard Officer Development', 'FC majors must complete the ILE common core curriculum for promotion to Lieutenant Colonel. Lieutenant Colonels must complete either the legacy Command and General Staff Officer Course, or the ILE Common Core curriculum and ILE Advanced Operations and Warfighting Course to be considered for SSC. SSC completion is highly recommended for promotion to Colonel. Field grade officers who have completed CCC in a different branch must complete the following ATIS classes; Disbursing Operations Course, Accounts Payable Administration Course; and the following ATRRS courses: GFEBS Cost Management and Army PPBE.', 'fbe1d751072f9799e6156f51440bcaee105248f3829e76305e7f85fbe0bf9b60', 14, 14, '14', 57),
